<h1>三、参数怎么改（V1 / V2 精确到 JSON 节点）</h1>

<p>节点名来自源实验完整 JSON（已存档 <code>.content/_baseline_params.json</code>）。在 Libra 复制实验后的参数编辑框里 Ctrl+F 搜节点名即可定位。</p>

<h2>3.1 V1：只改 1 个 key（merge_weight 200 → 150）</h2>

<table>
<colgroup><col width="320"/><col width="120"/><col width="80"/><col width="80"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr><th background-color="light-gray">JSON 节点</th><th background-color="light-gray">key</th><th background-color="light-gray">改前</th><th background-color="light-gray">改后</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><p><code>ad.targeting_test_recalls.eu_nt_pixel_iab_recall</code></p></td><td><p><code>merge_weight</code></p></td><td><p>200</p></td><td><p><b>150</b></p></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<p><b>调参逻辑</b>　merge_weight 决定本路在 snake_merge 阶段抽签的权重，调低 → 本路占坑减少 → 对其他主路挤压减少，用于在主路指标受挤压时减压。其余字段一律保持 baseline。</p>

<h2>3.2 V2：改 4 个 key（3 个 raw_feature_k + 1 个 random_bitmap k）</h2>

<table>
<colgroup><col width="360"/><col width="120"/><col width="80"/><col width="80"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr><th background-color="light-gray">JSON 节点</th><th background-color="light-gray">key</th><th background-color="light-gray">改前</th><th background-color="light-gray">改后</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><p><code>ad.targeting_dag_params.zbx_travel_pixel_id_feature_parser_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>raw_feature_k</code></p></td><td><p>100</p></td><td><p><b>150</b></p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>ad.targeting_dag_params.zbx_travel_adv_id_feature_parser_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>raw_feature_k</code></p></td><td><p>100</p></td><td><p><b>150</b></p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>ad.targeting_dag_params.zbx_travel_account_id_feature_parser_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>raw_feature_k</code></p></td><td><p>100</p></td><td><p><b>150</b></p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>ad.targeting_dag_params.zbx_travel_ads_pixel_adv_account_feature_random_bitmap_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>k</code></p></td><td><p>500</p></td><td><p><b>800</b></p></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

<p><b>调参逻辑</b>　feature_parser 调大 → 拉的原始特征条数变多 → 候选商品池变大；random_bitmap k 配合调大 → 截断不要把候选砍掉。用于 pass count 偏低、本路召回量不足的场景。V2 不动 merge_weight，保持 200。</p>

<h2>3.3 完全不动的字段</h2>

<table>
<colgroup><col width="320"/><col width="160"/><col width="80"/><col width="240"/></colgroup>
<thead>
<tr><th background-color="light-gray">节点</th><th background-color="light-gray">key</th><th background-color="light-gray">保留</th><th background-color="light-gray">不动原因</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><p><code>zbx_travel_pixel_adv_account_dedup_216_bitmap_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>top_k</code></p></td><td><p>600</p></td><td><p>等独占消耗率 &lt;30% 再单开版本动</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>zbx_travel_pixel_adv_account_dedup_24_bitmap_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>top_k</code></p></td><td><p>900</p></td><td><p>同上</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>zbx_travel_pixel_adv_account_dedup_2_bitmap_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>top_k</code></p></td><td><p>600</p></td><td><p>同上</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>zbx_travel_pixel_adv_account_mock_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>recall_flag</code></p></td><td><p>711</p></td><td><p>支路标识，绝不能改</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>zbx_travel_pixel_adv_account_recall_cid_struct_node.params</code></p></td><td><p><code>ads_per_adv_limit</code></p></td><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>本周不动</p></td></tr>
<tr><td><p><code>eu_nt_pixel_iab_recall</code></p></td><td><p><code>recall_config_key / group_snake_merge_path / collect_xid_deps_args / merge_deps_args</code></p></td><td><p>原值</p></td><td><p>支路结构骨架</p></td></tr>
